§ `ss 3, 4, 9 to 11, 13, 14, 16, 20, 21, 33`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `taking part in an illegal strike` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `failing to report a scheduled offence` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `obstructing a search` EQUALS 5000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `financing an illegal strike` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `possessing a subversive document` EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to report a scheduled offence` EQUALS 60

#ASSERT `the minimum imprisonment in months` `breaching a supervision obligation` EQUALS 12

#ASSERT NOT `the offence is arrestable and non-bailable` `taking part in an illegal strike`
#ASSERT `the offence is arrestable and non-bailable` `instigating an illegal strike`
#ASSERT `the offence is arrestable and non-bailable` `financing an illegal strike`

#ASSERT `a District Court can impose the full maximum` `taking part in an illegal strike`
#ASSERT NOT `a District Court can impose the full maximum` `possessing a subversive document`
#ASSERT `a District Court can impose the full maximum` `failing to report a scheduled offence`

